  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MKAPA FELLOWS PROGRAM PHASE IV (MFP IV): IMPROVING MATERNAL, NEW-BORN HEALTH SERVICES AND CLIMATE RESILIENT SYSTEMS&#x2013; BRIDGING GAP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Goal of Mkapa Fellows programme is to improve Health and Community Systems for addressing HIV/AIDS and Maternal health challenges in 13 districts of Tanzania, four of which are funded by Ireland. It focuses on strengthening community and primary healthcare systems by rolling out Community Health Workers programme and strengthening human resources for health through deployment of medical staff to work in selected remote health facilities with high shortage of staff.</narrative>
  </description>
